cabal-version: 3.0
name:          ghc-pin
version:       0
synopsis:      Force GHC's boot libraries into the build plan
description:
  Downstream consumers of @ouroboros-consensus@, such as @cardano-node@, also
  depend on the @ghc@ package. The installed @ghc@ package depends on the exact
  versions of the boot libraries that the compiler was built with, so the solver
  cannot pick a newer @bytestring@, @containers@, @time@ and so on. The result is
  that a build plan which works here can still fail downstream.

  This package exists only to reproduce that situation. It depends on @ghc@ and
  on nothing else. Cabal picks one version per package name for a whole project,
  so adding this package to the project pins the boot libraries for
  @ouroboros-consensus@ as well.

  Build it through @cabal.project.ghc-pin@ in the root of the repository. The
  @Check the build plan against GHC's boot libraries@ step of the build job in
  @.github/workflows/ci.yml@ runs that project for every compiler in the matrix.

build-type:    Simple

library
  default-language: Haskell2010
  build-depends:
    , base
    , ghc
